[00:00.000] 作词 : Chance Peña
[00:01.000] 作曲 : Chance Peña
[00:20.806] I’ve become a figment of my imagination
[00:37.906] That’s why I run towards self-love and inner restoration
[00:58.189] I don’t know what it is that I’m climbing to
[01:01.805] I hear your words in my head you said “The mountain is you”
[01:07.125] And only worry can bring me down
[01:15.563] I’m scared to let go of what I’m scared to lose
[01:19.360] I’m pouring out myself, I’d give it all for the view
[01:23.697] And only worry can bring me down
[01:28.474] You said “The mountain is you”
[01:38.747] "The mountain is you" (Yep)
[02:08.839] Heart and my hands don’t fail me now
[02:12.326] Won’t let the weight of my fear go and knock me down
[02:17.763] Only way’s up, no going around
[02:26.099] You called my name in the dead of night
[02:30.256] I was barely surviving almost left the climb
[02:35.200] Said don’t look down but open your eyes
[02:39.302] You were right, you said “The mountain is you”
[02:45.913] "The mountain is you"
[02:49.722] You said “The mountain is you”
[02:54.701] "The mountain is you"
